		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A foolish sorceress who made a soul-pact: power for eternal damnation.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 27, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 dagger (close/near) +3 (1d4) or 1 spell +6, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Blast (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 14. 4d6 damage to all within a near- sized cube within far.</p><p></p><p><strong>Edict (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 11. Focus. Non-chaotic creatures have DISADV to attack or cast spells against sorceress for duration.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pactsworn</strong>. Immune to fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Summon Lemures (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 14. Summon 1d8 loyal lemure devils that appear within near. They stay for 5 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
